{
  "_note": "近 7 天达标(21,158×60,card-design-system §8.1):左 = 今天达标几件 / 共几件;右 = 近 7 天七格浓淡,今天描边。2026-10-08 新增,零新增请求:复用 flow/week.df 的 c0..c6 / doneToday / total。",
  "rc": {
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "近 7 天达标",
        "today": "今天 ",
        "masked": "已隐藏"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Last 7 days",
        "today": "Today ",
        "masked": "Hidden"
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFB\\,#EEF7F3)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161B1D\\,#182221)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "10pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#2E9E6B|#45C793",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "19pt",
        "y": "9pt",
        "w": "92pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "113pt",
        "y": "10.5pt",
        "w": "35pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),${@i18n.masked},findNotEmpty::(${atLbl},--))]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "_note": "主值 = 今天达标几件 / 共几件(与 week 42 右上「今天 5/8」同一个量)。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${total},0),1),1,0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "num",
            "type": "richText",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "30pt",
            "w": "70pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "spans": [
              {
                "text": "${@i18n.today}",
                "fontSize": "10pt",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              },
              {
                "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${doneToday},0)]",
                "fontSize": "16.5pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "text": "/$[findNotEmpty::(${total},--)]",
                "fontSize": "10pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "numM",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "33pt",
            "w": "70pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "••",
            "fontSize": "16.5pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${total},0),1),0,1))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "numE",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "33pt",
            "w": "70pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "16.5pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "82.5pt",
        "y": "28pt",
        "w": "7.5pt",
        "h": "22pt",
        "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c0},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2pt",
          "leftB": "2pt",
          "rightT": "2pt",
          "rightB": "2pt"
        },
        "_note": "近 7 天每天跨所有事项达标件数的四档浓淡,色由 flow/week.df 算(c0..c6,与 week 42 同一组键)。"
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "92.0pt",
        "y": "28pt",
        "w": "7.5pt",
        "h": "22pt",
        "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c1},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2pt",
          "leftB": "2pt",
          "rightT": "2pt",
          "rightB": "2pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "101.5pt",
        "y": "28pt",
        "w": "7.5pt",
        "h": "22pt",
        "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c2},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2pt",
          "leftB": "2pt",
          "rightT": "2pt",
          "rightB": "2pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "111.0pt",
        "y": "28pt",
        "w": "7.5pt",
        "h": "22pt",
        "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c3},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2pt",
          "leftB": "2pt",
          "rightT": "2pt",
          "rightB": "2pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "120.5pt",
        "y": "28pt",
        "w": "7.5pt",
        "h": "22pt",
        "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c4},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2pt",
          "leftB": "2pt",
          "rightT": "2pt",
          "rightB": "2pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "130.0pt",
        "y": "28pt",
        "w": "7.5pt",
        "h": "22pt",
        "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c5},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2pt",
          "leftB": "2pt",
          "rightT": "2pt",
          "rightB": "2pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "139.5pt",
        "y": "28pt",
        "w": "7.5pt",
        "h": "22pt",
        "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c6},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2pt",
          "leftB": "2pt",
          "rightT": "2pt",
          "rightB": "2pt"
        },
        "id": "today",
        "borderColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "borderWidth": "1.5pt",
        "_note": "最右一格恒是今天(week.df 用 @time.nowMs 现算),描边标出。"
      }
    ]
  }
}
